  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With their connections to the gods of the Stone Court, Clerics are important contributors to raiding life. The Discovery Domain concerns itself with sailing, exploring, and seizing the riches to be found. These Clerics often serve as raid captains or navigators and within each clan they are honored, respected, and at times, feared. They have a favored god but respect them all and their divine power comes from the entirety of the Stone Court.</p>"
